        "en": "Multiple reviewers appreciate how thoughtfully their pets are handled during routine visits and urgent consultations. Cat and dog owners note that clinicians remain calm and patient with nervous or difficult animals, helping them feel settled and reducing distress during examinations and follow-up care."
      }
